un `gh pr ready 18`.\n\n8. Current Work:\n   I had just written src/pages/NetworkShare.jsx, the last subcomponent before the main page. NetworkPage.jsx, which wires NetworkEditor (Notations, LinksTable, stepped, randomLinks), NetworkStyle (Looks, StyleSections) and NetworkShare together, has not been written yet, and neither has network.css.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Write src/pages/NetworkPage.jsx, which wires the state, URL, preview and sections to the subcomponents just created, and src/pages/network.css. Then update the gallery cards with the hover share icon. Then run prettier, lint and tests, and make the first commits to branch issue-17-c029b2b48293.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /home/box/.claude/projects/-tmp-gh-issue-solver-1792853904677/4b241afc-c5bf-4ea5-a425-f0bcdd392493.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened.\n\nThe messages after this summary are the most recent messages from before compaction, kept verbatim. The summary was written without seeing them, so something it says has not happened yet may already have happened in them."
